## Error Handling

```javascript
try {
  // Potentially failing code
  const element = document.querySelector('#required');
  if (!element) {
    throw new Error('Required element not found');
  }
} catch (error) {
  console.error('curixus Theme Error:', error);
  // Graceful degradation
}
```

## Comments

- ALL comments in English
- Document complex logic
- Explain WHY, not WHAT (code shows what)

```javascript
// Good - explains reasoning
// Use two-layer crossfade to prevent flickering during rapid scroll changes
beginVariantTransition(bgEl, layers, nextVariant);

// Bad - states obvious
// Call the begin variant transition function
beginVariantTransition(bgEl, layers, nextVariant);
```

